# kk: Support native sampler LOD bias on M5+
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45410 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?

```
kk: Support native sampler LOD bias on M5+

For pre-compiled shaders, we still lower unconditionally. To handle this,
the bias value passed in through the descriptor is zeroed when the native
bias value is used.
```
